<title>SWEDEN: Stora says LWC, fine paper bookings strong.</title>
<headline>Stora says LWC, fine paper bookings strong.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company Stora AB said on Wednesday that order bookings for LWC (light-weight coated magazine paper) and fine paper were strong at the beginning of 1997.</p>
</text>
